From cfdcd05d7dc9b6832c3b541c93d5181ac1c8bf98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas <lucasgigli3@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:59:45 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 19/22] =?UTF-8?q?Plata:=20conciliar=20tambi=C3=A9n=20el=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?extracto=20de=20la=20cuenta=20con=20Claude=20Code?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- claude_code.rs: el pedido de modo isla le dice a Claude Code que elija conciliar-resumen
  (tarjeta de crédito) o conciliar-extracto (cuenta bancaria) leyendo el archivo;
  --allowedTools suma Bash(npm run -s conciliar:leer-cuenta*) y --add-dir la carpeta de la
  skill nueva, si está en la PC. Tests actualizados.
- plata.ts: delegar con conciliar_extracto se trata como conciliar_resumen; la tarjeta dice
  "extracto" cuando plata_resumen.id es null, los montos con signo se muestran con su signo y
  el mensaje de faltantes dice egreso/ingreso.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 windows/src-tauri/src/claude_code.rs | 126 ++++++++++++++++++++-------
 windows/src/views/plata.ts           |  55 ++++++++----
 2 files changed, 134 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)

diff --git a/windows/src-tauri/src/claude_code.rs b/windows/src-tauri/src/claude_code.rs
index 59fd84e..48c950f 100644
--- a/windows/src-tauri/src/claude_code.rs
+++ b/windows/src-tauri/src/claude_code.rs
@@ -1,10 +1,13 @@
-// Reconciling a card statement with Claude Code, headless, on Lucas's own plan.
+// Reconciling a card statement, or a bank-account statement, with Claude Code,
+// headless, on Lucas's own plan.
 //
 // The Plata agent (plata_agent.rs) runs on the API and is billed per token.
 // Reconciling a statement is a long read of a PDF against many rows, so the
 // island hands it to Claude Code instead: `claude -p` in the background, with
-// the `conciliar-resumen` skill, which leaves `datos.json` and `informe.html`
-// in a folder of its own. Nothing here writes to Plata.
+// the `conciliar-resumen` skill (a credit-card statement) or `conciliar-extracto`
+// (the bank account's statement; Claude Code reads the file and picks), which
